User-reported UI correction after real Ollama update test.

Root causes:
- the empty indeterminate percentage occupied less height than the determinate percentage, so preparation -> download changed the measured window height;
- CSS elevation extended beyond a webview sized exactly to the card and was clipped at the window bounds;
- the 380 px card was too compact in real use.

Fix:
- reserve a stable 16 px measurement row from preparation onward;
- give the 440 px content card transparent shadow gutters (464 px native width total), measure the outer frame, and disable the rectangular native shadow;
- preserve the shared relief and radius tokens.

Evidence:
- RED: update-window-layout.test.ts failed against the 380 px window without shadow gutters.
- GREEN: 23/23 targeted frontend tests passed; layout regression 5/5 passed after the final test edit.
- npx tsc --noEmit passed.
